msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/getloadavg.3:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Since glibc 2.19:\n"
"        _DEFAULT_SOURCE\n"
"    In glibc up to and including 2.19:\n"
"        _BSD_SOURCE\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/getloadavg.3:43
msgid ""
"The B<getloadavg>()  function returns the number of processes in the system "
"run queue averaged over various periods of time.  Up to I<n> samples are "
"retrieved and assigned to successive elements of I<loadavg[]>.  The system "
"imposes a maximum of 3 samples, representing averages over the last 1, 5, "
"and 15 minutes, respectively."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/getloadavg.3:48
msgid ""
"If the load average was unobtainable, -1 is returned; otherwise, the number "
"of samples actually retrieved is returned."
msgstr ""

